## Fix: Blog Section Empty Cards
- Root cause: `blog-page` single type in Strapi no longer has a `posts` relation
  - Posts were migrated to the separate `blog-posts` collection type
  - `index.astro` was still trying to read `posts` from `blog-page` → empty array
- Fix: Updated `src/pages/index.astro` to fetch `blog-posts` collection via `fetchCollection`
  - Maps collection fields to component props: `documentId→id`, `slug→link`, `category.name→category`, `readTime→read_time`
  - Both `es` and `en` locales fetched and mapped
- Verified: Blog card now renders in dist HTML with real Strapi data
  - Title: "Post de Prueba", date, read time, category, resume all present
  - Accordion item also renders correctly

