  - Blog card: wallper.jpg from Strapi with srcset, properly filling 16/9 container
  - Blog hero: wallper.jpg from Strapi filling 120px hero container
- 30 test files, 160 tests passing, 0 lint errors
- Root cause 4: CSS with :global(.class img) selectors were redundant after removing <picture>
